  "content": "<h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">更多的矿石和合成&nbsp;</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/many-more-ores-and-crafts\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_1092861_downloads.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"CurseForge 下载量\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmany-more-ores-and-crafts\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/dynamic/json?color=2d2d2d&colorA=17b85a&style=flat-square&label=&suffix= downloads&query=downloads&url=https://api.modrinth.com/v2/project/6kAZrZHA&logo=modrinth&logoColor=2d2d2d\" alt=\"Modrinth 下载量\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">添加了 14 种矿石和配方 <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">(矿石、物品、工具、方块、盔甲)</span>:</span></strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic;color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em>精金&nbsp;</em></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic;color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em>紫水晶&nbsp;</em></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic;color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em>钴&nbsp;</em></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic;color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em>地狱岩&nbsp;</em></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic;color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em>铅&nbsp;</em></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic;color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em>秘银&nbsp;</em></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic;color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em>黑曜石</em></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic;color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em>欧帕尔铜</em></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic;color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em>钯</em></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic;color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em>铂&nbsp;</em></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic;color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em>银&nbsp;</em></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic;color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em>锡</em></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic;color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em>钛</em></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic;color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em>钨</em></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">生成方式:</span></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">锡 (常见)</span> &nbsp;-&gt; 0-256<br><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">铅 (常见)</span> -&gt; 0-112</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">银 (常见)</span> -&gt; 0-64<br><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">钨 (常见)</span> -&gt; 0-64</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\">铂 (不常见) </span>-&gt; 0-64</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">地狱岩 (稀有) <span style=\"color:#ba372a\">[下界]</span></span> </span>-&gt; 0-112</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\">钴 (不常见)</span> -&gt; 0-32<br><span style=\"color:#3598db\">钯 (不常见) </span>-&gt; 0-32</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">精金 (稀有) </span>-&gt; (-32)-0<br><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">欧帕尔铜 (稀有)</span> -&gt; (-32)-0</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">钛 (史诗) </span>-&gt; (-64)-(-32)<br><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">秘银 (史诗) </span>-&gt; (-64)-(-32)</p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>成就:</strong></span></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092861/description_52ef8c55-bdf0-47ca-8f3c-172519ba8836.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">各矿石对应的模组:</span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tin-ores-and-crafts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">锡矿石与合成</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/silver-ores-and-crafts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">银矿石与合成</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lead-ores-and-crafts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">铅矿石与合成</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/titanium-ores-and-crafts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">钛矿石与合成</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythril-ores-and-crafts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">秘银矿石与合成</a></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">语言支持:</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">英语 (en_us)</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">西班牙语 (es_us, es_es, es_mx, es_ec, es_ve, es_uy)</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">葡萄牙语 (pt_br, pt_pt) <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">[仅限版本 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">1.21.1, </span></span>1.21.4 和 1.21.5]</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">简体中文 (zh_cn) <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">[<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">仅限</span></span> 版本 1.21.1, 1.21.4 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">和 1.21.5</span></span>]</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">俄语 (ru_ru) <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">[<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">仅限</span></span> 版本 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">1.21.1, </span></span>1.21.4 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">和 1.21.5</span></span>]</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">意大利语 (it_it)&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">[<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">仅限</span></span> 版本 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">1.20.1, 1.21.4 和 1.21.5</span></span>] <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">{由 <a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/zeroxxii/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ZeroXXII} 提供</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">法语 (fr_fr)&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">[<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">仅限</span></span> 版本 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">1.20.1, 1.21.4 和 1.21.5</span></span>]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>由 AI 翻译 (pt_br, pt_pt, zh_cn, ru_ru, fr_fr)</em></p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>本模组在 1.20.x - 1.21.x 版本 (1.0.8) 中使用与其他模组兼容的标签</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
